Problem 9
✏️ Steps / Flow
Create an empty set.
Go through each element in the list.
Calculate the required value as k − current element.
Check if the required value exists in the set.
If it exists, return true.
Otherwise, add the current element to the set.
If no pair is found, return false.

START

Input nums and k

Create empty set

FOR each element in nums
    target = k - element

    IF target exists in set THEN
        Return True
    END IF

    Add element to set
END FOR

Return False

STOP
